      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm yeah, it looks like we should maybe just have the same doc string for that struct too. Howver, I\u0027m not too familiar with when that struct is used in Soong and what the intended default behavior is. I.e. is the documentation wrong, or is there a bug in the code compared to the expected behavior?\n\nI suspect it\u0027s just a docs issue, but maybe someone with more knowledge could confirm?",
